  "title": "Alaska Army National Guardsmen Support Hurricane Florence Relief Efforts",
  "description": "Alaska Army National Guardsmen from 1st Battalion, 207th  Aviation Regiment, assist with Hurricane Florence relief operations via two UH-60 Black Hawk helicopters from McEntire Joint National Guard Base, South Carolina, Sept. 22, 2018. The Black Hawks are equipped with 300-foot hoists that will allow aircrews to provide aeromedical evacuation, rescue people and retrieve and deliver equipment and supplies where landing is not possible in the aftermath of Hurricane Florence. Run Time: 03:16.",
